# Fault.Bounds with a NEGATIVE index (error-model.md §11.6 caveat): a negative
# index is a CATCHABLE Bounds INSIDE a catch (gorget_array_safe_get returns NULL
# for index < 0), and a panic OUTSIDE one. Here it's caught → the fallback.
void main():
    Vector[int] xs = [10, 20, 30]
    int r = (xs[-1]) catch Fault.Bounds: -1
    print(f"{r}")
